.Dd November 16, 2026
.Dt DTRACE 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm dtrace
.Nd inspect RavenBSD DTrace probes and records
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl l
.Op Fl e Ar id
.Op Fl d Ar id
.Op Fl r Ar count
.Op Fl s
.Op Fl c
.Op Fl u
.Op Fl h
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm is the userland consumer for the kernel DTrace provider.
With no action it lists the registered probes.
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl l
List probes as
.Dq id provider name .
.It Fl e Ar id
Enable the probe
.Ar id .
.It Fl d Ar id
Disable the probe
.Ar id .
.It Fl r Ar count
Read and print up to
.Ar count
records.
.It Fl s
Print per-CPU ring statistics: produced, consumed, dropped and capacity.
.It Fl c
Clear the rings and counters; every probe must be disabled first.
.It Fl u
List the USDT marker sites and each site's marker opcode.
.It Fl h
Print usage.
.El
.Pp
Records are printed as
.Dq cpu=N probe=N tid=N syscall=N ts=N args=A0,A1,A2,A3 .
The probe and record layouts are the S57
.Xr dtrace_read 2
wire records.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD ABI v1.
